          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "שבת—We must remember that it is the power and sanctity of Shabbos that gives us the \"energy\" to remain spiritually strong during the week."
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 0
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "I believe with perfect faith that Hashem created everything and guides all creations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "I believe with perfect faith that Hashem is One and Unique and that He alone is our God."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "I believe with perfect faith that Hashem is not physical at all."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "I believe with perfect faith that Hashem is eternal; He is first and last."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "I believe with perfect faith that it is only to Hashem (*and directly to Him*) that we should pray."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "I believe with perfect faith that all the words of the Neviim are true."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "I believe with perfect faith that the prophecy of Moshe was true, and that he was the chief of all the prophets."
            }
          ]
        }
